  ('afdb7bae-43e4-5bf3-9def-84f9e491dcc0', 'public', null, null, null, null, null, 'Honoured in the 1933 founding of Arya High School, Chakwal. Had four sons: Prabh Dyal, Shoba Ram, Kalu Ram and Hari Singh.', 'Jaggi Family Tree PDF: ''The Jaggi Family Lineage, Pre-Partition Chakwal'' (five generations from Bakhshi Bhanna Mal Jaggi)
Bakhshi Hari Singh Jaggi branch PDF (generations 1 to 6), compiled from family oral history and pre-Partition Chakwal archives
Donor plaque, Arya High School, Chakwal, April 1933: ''Built in memory of their Grandfather Bakhshi Kesar Mal Jaggi by his grandsons Bir Chand and Gyan Parkash, Sons of Bakhshi Prabh Dyal Jaggi, Timber Merchants, Chakwal.'' Transcribed at http://speakingstones1.blogspot.com/2018/04/arya-high-school-chakwal-punjab-pakistan.html; reported in Dawn (https://www.dawn.com/news/660028, 2011; https://www.dawn.com/news/1472898, 2019) and The Friday Times (https://thefridaytimes.com/03-Apr-2024/arya-high-school-offers-a-glimpse-of-life-in-pre-partition-chakwal, 2024)', null),
